# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read [ffsim’s own guides](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/) for the workflows it owns, in particular [building a UCJ ansatz](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html) and [optimizing one variationally](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/simulate-vqe.html). The parameter vectors those guides drive are what [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") and [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") accept, through the operators they build.\n"
msgstr "Citește [ghidurile proprii ale ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/) pentru fluxurile de lucru pe care le deține, în special [construirea unui ansatz UCJ](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html) și [optimizarea lui variațională](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/simulate-vqe.html). Vectorii de parametri pe care îi manipulează aceste ghiduri sunt cei pe care [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") și [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") îi acceptă, prin operatorii pe care îi construiesc.\n"
